msgid "Enable local TX aggregation (upload)"
msgstr "启用本地发送聚合（上传）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Local TX aggregation"
msgstr "本地发送聚合"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Controls client upload only. When enabled, any enabled queue, rate, or byte-count trigger activates aggregation (OR). When disabled, upload data always uses the preferred leg; server downlink and UDP are unchanged."
msgstr "仅控制客户端上传。开启时，队列、速率、累计字节三个独立条件之间为“或”关系，任一已启用条件满足即可触发聚合。关闭时，上传数据始终使用优选路径；服务端下行和 UDP 不受影响。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Activate on preferred queue"
msgstr "优选路径队列触发"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger: activate when the preferred send queue stays at least 80% full for the activation window. All triggers disabled means preferred-only TX."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件：优选路径发送队列占用持续达到 80%，且持续时间达到激活窗口时触发。关闭全部触发条件后，发送数据仅使用优选路径。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger: average local TX rate per connection, in Mbps. 0 disables this trigger. If empty, sing-box uses 150 unless a non-zero byte-count trigger is configured."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件：每连接的本地平均发送速率，单位 Mbps。0 关闭此条件。留空时，未启用累计字节触发则默认为 150，已启用则默认为 0。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger: cumulative locally sent bytes per connection. 0 or empty disables this trigger. Accepts bytes or a memory size such as <code>2MB</code>."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件：每连接本地累计发送字节数。0 或留空关闭此条件。支持字节数或 <code>2MB</code> 等大小写法。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger: cumulative locally sent bytes per connection. 0 disables this trigger."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件：每连接本地累计发送字节数。0 关闭此条件。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Only the byte-count trigger requires this minimum average rate over a complete activation window, in Mbps. 0 or empty removes the rate gate; queue and rate triggers remain independent."
msgstr "仅累计字节触发需要额外满足完整激活窗口内的最低平均速率，单位 Mbps。0 或留空取消此速率门槛；队列和速率触发仍独立生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Rate measurement window and sustained high-queue duration, in seconds. Applies independently to each connection and local sending direction."
msgstr "速率测量窗口及高队列占用持续时间，单位秒。对每个连接和本地发送方向独立生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Additional node for aggregation. It remains available for server downlink when local TX aggregation is disabled."
msgstr "用于聚合的附加节点。即使关闭本地发送聚合，服务端下行仍可使用该节点。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Preferred leg bandwidth weight"
msgstr "优选路径带宽权重"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Secondary leg bandwidth weight"
msgstr "辅助路径带宽权重"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Expected local TX capacity in Mbps, used only as a relative scheduling weight. This does not limit bandwidth."
msgstr "预计的本地发送容量，单位 Mbps，仅用作相对调度权重，不会限制带宽。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Configured bandwidth hint · normalized weight share · scheduler weight. These guide local TX scheduling; the percentage is not measured traffic share and none of these values imposes a rate limit."
msgstr "配置的带宽参考值 · 归一化权重占比 · 调度权重。仅用于本地发送调度；百分比不是实测速率占比，这些数值均不限制带宽。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Upload: current backlog / queue capacity (peak backlog). Download: remote current backlog (peak backlog); remote capacity is not shown."
msgstr "上传：当前积压 / 队列容量（积压峰值）。下载：远端当前积压（积压峰值）；未显示远端队列容量。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Traffic on this leg since process start, including TCP payload and UDP when this child is selected for UDP. Download is RX; upload is TX. Protocol overhead is excluded."
msgstr "本路径自进程启动以来的累计流量，包含 TCP 载荷及该节点被选为 UDP 出口时的 UDP 流量。下载为 RX，上传为 TX，不含协议封装开销。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Controls client upload only. When disabled, upload data always uses the preferred leg; server downlink and UDP are unchanged. Saved trigger settings are retained while hidden."
msgstr "仅控制客户端上传。关闭时，上传数据始终使用优选路径；服务端下行和 UDP 不受影响。隐藏触发条件时会保留已保存的设置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Activation logic: condition 1 OR condition 2 OR condition 3. Any enabled condition can activate aggregation; disabling all three keeps upload on the preferred leg."
msgstr "触发逻辑：条件 1 或 条件 2 或 条件 3。任意一个已启用的条件满足即可触发聚合；三个条件全部关闭时，上传仅使用优选路径。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Condition 1: preferred queue"
msgstr "条件 1：优选路径队列"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Condition 2: average TX rate"
msgstr "条件 2：平均发送速率"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Condition 3: cumulative TX bytes"
msgstr "条件 3：累计发送字节"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Additional minimum rate for condition 3"
msgstr "条件 3 的附加最低速率"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Extra requirement for condition 3 only: the byte count and this minimum average rate over a complete activation window must both be satisfied. In Mbps; 0 or empty removes the rate gate. Conditions 1 and 2 remain independent."
msgstr "仅为条件 3 的附加要求：累计字节数与完整激活窗口内的最低平均速率必须同时满足。单位 Mbps；0 或留空取消此速率门槛。条件 1 和条件 2 仍独立生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Multipath scheduling"
msgstr "Multipath 调度"

msgid "Automatic delivery-based scheduling"
msgstr "基于交付反馈自动调度"

msgid "Requires singbox-multipath beta5 (protocol v8). Scheduling uses end-to-end delivery feedback, not configured bandwidth weights. Old bandwidth settings are ignored and are no longer generated. Both endpoints must use the same protocol version."
msgstr "需要 singbox-multipath beta5（协议 v8）。调度依据端到端交付反馈，不再使用手动带宽权重。旧带宽设置会被忽略，不再写入生成配置。两端必须使用相同协议版本。"

msgid "Independent OR trigger: activate when preferred-path in-flight plus local unsent bytes remain at least 80% of the pending-send byte capacity for the activation window. All triggers disabled means preferred-only TX."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件：优选路径在途字节与本地待发送字节之和，在激活窗口内持续达到待发送容量的 80%。所有条件均关闭时，仅通过优选路径发送。"

msgid "Independent OR trigger: activate when the preferred path in-flight plus local unsent bytes remain at least 80% of the configured pending-send byte capacity for the activation window. All triggers disabled means preferred-only TX."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件：优选路径在途字节与本地待发送字节之和，在激活窗口内持续达到待发送容量的 80%。所有条件均关闭时，仅通过优选路径发送。"

msgid "Pending send capacity"
msgstr "待发送容量"

msgid "Local unsent byte capacity per connection, in chunk-size units. It does not cap whole-path in-flight data. Path scheduling uses measured delivery, with no bandwidth weights."
msgstr "每条连接的本地待发送容量，以 chunk_size 为单位。不限制整条路径的在途数据。调度依据实际交付反馈，不使用带宽权重。"

msgid "Maximum receive window"
msgstr "最大接收窗口"

msgid "Local RX byte window, including in-order data awaiting application reads. Empty or 0 derives the ceiling from the shared memory budget: 224 MiB with a 512 MiB budget. Receive storage is allocated only for arriving data. This ceiling and the optional chunk-count ceiling both apply."
msgstr "本地接收字节窗口，包含等待应用读取的连续数据。留空或 0 时由共享内存预算推导上限：预算为 512 MiB 时上限为 224 MiB。仅为实际到达的数据分配存储。此上限与可选的块数上限同时生效。"

msgid "Additional receive window cap (chunks)"
msgstr "附加接收窗口上限（块）"

msgid "Optional local RX ceiling in negotiated chunk-size units, not a count of received wire frames. Empty or 0 adds no extra ceiling. Otherwise use 64–65536; the smaller of this byte capacity and the receive-window byte limit applies."
msgstr "可选的本地接收上限，以协商后的 chunk_size 为单位，不是收到的协议帧数量。留空或 0 表示不附加此上限；否则范围为 64–65536。换算后的字节容量与接收窗口字节上限取较小值。"

msgid "Connection send buffer bytes"
msgstr "连接发送缓冲区字节数"

msgid "Retained local TX bytes for both legs, released only by the peer cumulative Data ACK. Empty or 0 derives the ceiling from the shared memory budget. This is not a per-path bandwidth limit."
msgstr "为两条路径保留的本地发送数据，仅在收到对端累计 Data ACK 后释放。留空或 0 时由共享内存预算推导上限。这不是路径带宽限制。"

msgid "Minimum reinjection timeout"
msgstr "最小重注入超时"

msgid "In seconds. Empty or 0 uses adaptive delivery timing. A stalled path is paused, not automatically disconnected."
msgstr "单位为秒。留空或 0 时根据交付时延自适应计算。停滞的路径会暂停调度，不会因此自动断开。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "调度方式"

msgid "Both paths share a byte stream, cumulative Data ACK and receive window. Path delivery feedback drives scheduling; manual bandwidth weights are not used."
msgstr "两条路径共享字节流、累计 Data ACK 和接收窗口。调度依据路径交付反馈，不使用手动带宽权重。"

msgid "Upload preferred only"
msgstr "上传仅用优选路径"

msgid "Upload aggregation active"
msgstr "上传聚合已激活"

msgid "Download on leg1"
msgstr "当前经 leg1 下载"

msgid "Connections using preferred-only local TX. This does not disable server downlink aggregation."
msgstr "本地发送仅使用优选路径的连接数，不代表服务端下行聚合被关闭。"

msgid "Connections with local TX aggregation activated, even if currently idle."
msgstr "已激活本地发送聚合的连接数，包含当前空闲的连接。"

msgid "Connections with leg1 receive traffic in the current sample, not a persistent activation count."
msgstr "当前采样中有 leg1 接收流量的连接数，不是持续记录的激活连接数。"

msgid "No extra chunk cap"
msgstr "无附加块数上限"

msgid "%d chunks"
msgstr "%d 块"

msgid "Send history / Recovery floor"
msgstr "发送历史 / 恢复时延下限"

msgid "Adaptive"
msgstr "自适应"

msgid "Connection send history"
msgstr "连接发送历史"

msgid "Reinjection"
msgstr "重注入"

msgid "peak flow"
msgstr "单连接峰值"

msgid "Path in-flight data"
msgstr "路径在途数据"

msgid "Remote delivery estimate"
msgstr "远端交付估计"

msgid "No delivery sample"
msgstr "暂无交付样本"

msgid "Historical totals only"
msgstr "仅保留历史统计"

msgid "%s (stale)"
msgstr "%s（已过期）"

msgid "Each direction: logical bytes accepted but not yet Data-ACKed, including both paths and unsent data. Current is summed across active connections. Peak is the maximum of sampled node totals and observed per-connection peaks since process start; it is not an exact continuous aggregate high-water mark. Download is remote telemetry."
msgstr "各方向：已接受但尚未收到 Data ACK 的逻辑字节，包含两条路径及待发送数据。当前值为活跃连接之和；峰值取进程启动以来节点采样总量与各连接已观测峰值的最大值，并非连续精确测得的聚合峰值。下行数据来自远端遥测。"

msgid "Each direction: reinjected bytes / reinjected mappings / path stall detections. Recovery can use either available path; these are not packet loss counters."
msgstr "各方向：重注入字节数 / 重注入映射数 / 检测到路径停滞的次数。恢复可使用任一可用路径；这些不是网络丢包计数。"

msgid "Out-of-order receive storage: bytes / 16 KiB pages. Current is summed across active connections. Each peak is the largest per-connection peak among currently active connections; it may disappear when a connection closes. Byte and page peaks may occur at different times. Pages are not wire frames."
msgstr "乱序接收存储：字节数 / 16 KiB 页数。当前值为活跃连接之和；峰值是当前活跃连接各自峰值中的最大值，连接关闭后可能下降。字节峰值与页数峰值可能不在同一时刻出现。页数不是协议帧数。"

msgid "Remote telemetry availability and freshness. With no active sample, historical totals may remain. Stale values are retained and marked, not treated as live measurements. Timestamp: last received update."
msgstr "远端遥测的可用性和新鲜度。没有活跃样本时仍可能保留历史统计。过期值会保留并标记，不作为实时测量。时间戳表示最近收到更新的时间。"

msgid "Scheduling uses bytes outstanding through the whole child path and peer-observed delivery rate. No configured bandwidth ratio or rate limit is applied."
msgstr "调度依据整条子路径的在途字节以及对端观测的交付速率，不使用手动配置的带宽比例或速率上限。"

msgid "Remote sender estimate: sum of path delivery rates across active connections · largest smoothed DATA delivery RTT · smallest recorded DATA delivery RTT. These are scheduler observations, not configured bandwidth, physical ping latency, or packet-loss measurements."
msgstr "远端发送侧估计：活跃连接的路径交付速率之和 · 最大平滑 DATA 交付 RTT · 最小已记录 DATA 交付 RTT。这些是调度器观测值，不是配置带宽、物理 ping 延迟或丢包率。"

msgid "Each direction: bytes assigned to this path but not yet covered by a whole-path receipt, including child transport buffers. Current is summed across active connections. Peak is the maximum of sampled node totals and observed per-connection peaks since process start. This is not local queue utilization. Download is remote telemetry."
msgstr "各方向：已分配到此路径但尚未获整条路径收讫确认的字节，包括子传输缓冲区。当前值为活跃连接之和；峰值取进程启动以来节点采样总量与各连接已观测峰值的最大值。这不是本地队列利用率。下行数据来自远端遥测。"

msgid "Each direction: bytes currently held by writers, summed across connections / longest current write-blocked duration among active connections. Download is reported by the remote sender."
msgstr "各方向：各连接写入器当前持有的总字节数 / 活跃连接中当前最长的写入阻塞时间。下行数据由远端发送侧报告。"

msgid "Path delivery stalled. The sender can reinject missing byte ranges on another available path; a timing stall alone does not close the leg."
msgstr "路径交付停滞。发送侧可在另一条可用路径上重注入缺失的字节范围；仅时延停滞不会关闭路径。"

msgid "Unsupported status schema: %s. This page requires singbox-multipath beta5 status schema 3; upgrade sing-box and restart HomeProxy."
msgstr "不支持的状态格式：%s。此页面需要 singbox-multipath beta5 的状态格式 3；请升级 sing-box 并重启 HomeProxy。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Requires the updated singbox-multipath beta5 (protocol v9) on both endpoints. Legacy bandwidth settings are ignored."
msgstr "两端均需要更新后的 singbox-multipath beta5（协议 v9）。旧带宽设置会被忽略。"

msgid "Multipath transport"
msgstr "Multipath 传输"

msgid "Service shutdown"
msgstr "服务关闭"

msgid "Local application endpoint"
msgstr "本端业务连接"

msgid "Remote application endpoint"
msgstr "对端业务连接"

msgid "Unattributed"
msgstr "来源未确认"

msgid "Confirmed application-endpoint closures are hidden. Unattributed events remain visible; the destination identifies the affected flow, not the cause. Occurrences includes hidden events."
msgstr "已确认由业务端引起的关闭不会显示。来源未确认的事件仍保留；目标地址表示受影响的流，不代表故障来源。事件次数包含已隐藏事件。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Remote scheduler estimate"
msgstr "远端调度器估计"

msgid "Feedback RTT"
msgstr "交付反馈 RTT"

msgid "Probe RTT (active flows)"
msgstr "探测 RTT（活跃连接）"

msgid "Probe health (active flows)"
msgstr "探测状态（活跃连接）"

msgid "Each direction, cumulative since process start: reinjected bytes / reinjected mappings / path stall detections. A stall can recover before reinjection, so detections may be nonzero with zero reinjected bytes. These are not TCP/QUIC retransmissions or IP packet loss counters."
msgstr "各方向，自进程启动累计：重注入字节 / 重注入映射数 / 路径停滞检测次数。停滞可能在重注入前恢复，因此检测次数非零时重注入字节仍可能为零。这些不是 TCP/QUIC 重传或 IP 丢包计数。"

msgid "Each direction, summed across connections since process start: wait count / accumulated wait time for pending-send or retained-history capacity. This is not the longest stall or network queueing delay. Shared-memory pressure has separate counters."
msgstr "各方向，自进程启动跨连接累计：等待次数 / 因待发送容量或发送历史容量不足而等待的总时间。这不是最长单次停顿或网络排队延迟。共享内存压力使用独立计数。"

msgid "Sum of the remote scheduler delivery-rate estimates for active connections; idle connections may retain their last estimate. This is neither current one-second throughput nor physical link capacity. Feedback RTT is DATA via this leg plus feedback via leg0, including queueing: largest smoothed RTT / smallest recorded RTT across active connections."
msgstr "远端调度器对活跃连接的交付速率估计之和，空闲连接可能保留上次估计。它既不是当前一秒吞吐，也不是物理链路容量。交付反馈 RTT 为数据经此路径发出、反馈经 leg0 返回的总时延，包含排队；显示活跃连接中的最大平滑 RTT / 最小已记录 RTT。"

msgid "Since process start: locally attached leg transports, independent of TX activation · secondary dial attempts (leg0: logical connections created) · last-reported remote failures, including closed connections. An attached lazy leg0 may still be completing its handshake. Unreported remote events cannot be counted."
msgstr "自进程启动累计：本地成功挂接的路径传输实例，与发送聚合是否激活无关 · 次路径拨号尝试次数（leg0 为创建的逻辑连接数）· 已报告的远端失败次数，包含已关闭连接。延迟建连的 leg0 挂接时握手可能尚未完成。未报告的远端事件无法计入。"

msgid "Same-leg multipath ping/pong RTT, including child transport queueing. Active connections only: sample-weighted latest value · mean across samples · sample-weighted EWMA · minimum-maximum · sample-weighted jitter. Closed connections are excluded; one sample cannot characterize variability."
msgstr "同一路径的 multipath ping/pong 往返时延，包含子传输排队。仅统计活跃连接：按样本数加权的最新值 · 全部样本均值 · 加权 EWMA · 最小-最大值 · 加权抖动。已关闭连接不计入；单个样本无法反映波动。"

msgid "Active connections only: probes sent · probe timeouts · timeout/sent ratio. These counters can decrease when connections close. A pending probe is not yet a success or timeout; zero timeouts with few samples does not establish link quality. This is not raw IP packet loss."
msgstr "仅统计活跃连接：已发送探测数 · 超时数 · 超时/发送比例。连接关闭时这些计数可能下降。等待响应的探测尚不能算成功或超时；样本很少时零超时不能证明链路质量。这不是原始 IP 丢包率。"

msgid "Last remote failure stage reported by an active connection. Unlike the cumulative failure counter, this detail is not retained after that connection closes."
msgstr "活跃连接报告的最近远端失败阶段。与累计失败次数不同，此详情不会在对应连接关闭后保留。"

msgid "Enable TCP and UDP failover"
msgstr "启用 TCP 和 UDP 故障接管"

msgid "Failover active"
msgstr "故障接管中"

msgid "Upload single-path"
msgstr "上传单路径"

msgid "Connections without local TX aggregation. Optional failover may use leg1; server downlink aggregation remains independent."
msgstr "未启用本端发送聚合的连接。可选的故障接管可使用 leg1，服务端下行聚合仍独立控制。"

msgid "Preferred UDP child. Without recovery it forwards directly; with recovery both paths use the same server UDP relay. UDP is not aggregated."
msgstr "UDP 首选子节点。未启用接管时直接转发；启用后双路径均使用同一服务端 UDP 中继。UDP 不进行聚合。"

msgid "Controls client upload aggregation only. Any enabled condition activates aggregation (OR). Disabling aggregation does not disable optional failover or change server downlink policy."
msgstr "仅控制客户端上传聚合，任一已启用条件均可触发（或）。关闭聚合不关闭可选故障接管，也不改变服务端下行策略。"

msgid "Failover timeout"
msgstr "故障判定超时"

msgid "Failback stability period"
msgstr "回切稳定等待时间"

msgid "TCP and UDP failover"
msgstr "TCP 和 UDP 故障接管"

msgid "Recovery paths"
msgstr "当前接管路径"

msgid "Failure timeout / Stable return"
msgstr "故障超时 / 稳定回切"

msgid "Shared recovery health"
msgstr "共享接管探测状态"

msgid "TCP reply age / UDP reply age / Healthy for"
msgstr "TCP 响应距今 / UDP 响应距今 / 持续健康"

msgid "Recovery role"
msgstr "接管角色"

msgid "Healthy"
msgstr "健康"

msgid "TCP control"
msgstr "TCP 控制路径"

msgid "TCP standby or aggregation"
msgstr "TCP 备用或聚合路径"

msgid "UDP selected"
msgstr "UDP 当前路径"

msgid "UDP standby"
msgstr "UDP 备用路径"

msgid "Without failover, UDP uses this child directly. With failover, this is the preferred UDP leg; both legs relay through the multipath server to preserve its UDP source port. Choosing leg1 does not make UDP follow TCP failback to leg0."
msgstr "未启用接管时，UDP 直接使用此子节点。启用后，此项表示 UDP 首选路径，两条路径均通过 multipath 服务端中继并保持 UDP 出口端口。选择 leg1 时，UDP 不会跟随 TCP 回切至 leg0。"

msgid "Requires singbox-multipath beta6 on both endpoints. Legacy bandwidth settings are ignored."
msgstr "双端均需使用 singbox-multipath beta6。旧版带宽配置会被忽略。"

msgid "Controls client upload aggregation only. When disabled, upload uses leg0 unless optional failover is active. Server downlink is independent. Saved trigger settings are retained while hidden."
msgstr "仅控制客户端上传聚合。关闭时上传使用 leg0，但可选的故障接管仍可使用 leg1。服务端下行独立控制。隐藏的触发条件保留已保存值。"

msgid "Client-only, disabled by default, with no additional recovery probes. The server always supports recovery and has no failover_enabled option. Allow both TCP and UDP on its listening port; both child nodes must support UDP. Existing TCP sessions and the server UDP socket survive a leg0 outage; UDP is not aggregated."
msgstr "仅客户端配置，默认关闭，不增加接管探测。服务端始终支持接管，没有 failover_enabled 选项。需放行监听端口的 TCP 和 UDP，两个子节点均需支持 UDP。leg0 中断后保留原 TCP 会话及服务端 UDP socket；UDP 不进行聚合。"

msgid "Seconds without a fresh TCP or UDP health reply before the shared path is unavailable. Default: 5 seconds. These probes are shared by all connections, not sent per flow."
msgstr "TCP 或 UDP 健康探测连续未收到有效响应达到此秒数后，判定路径不可用。默认 5 秒。所有连接共享探测，不为每条流单独探测。"

msgid "Seconds the preferred path must stay healthy before returning to it. Default: 30 seconds. A single missed probe does not restart this period; another full failure timeout does. If the fallback fails, an available preferred path is used immediately."
msgstr "首选路径持续健康达到此秒数后回切，默认 30 秒。单次漏回包不重置计时，再次达到完整故障超时才重置。若备用路径故障，则立即使用已可用的首选路径。"

msgid "Optional recovery is independent of the aggregation switches. With recovery disabled, no recovery probes or UDP relay are created."
msgstr "故障接管独立于聚合开关。关闭后不创建接管探测或 UDP 中继。"

msgid "Current TCP control path and selected UDP leg. UDP retains its own preference. A zero usable mask means no path is currently healthy."
msgstr "当前 TCP 控制路径及 UDP 所选路径。UDP 保持独立的首选路径设置。可用路径掩码为零表示当前没有健康路径。"

msgid "No fresh reply timeout · continuous healthy period before returning to the preferred path. Values are controlled by the client and synchronized to the server."
msgstr "未收到有效响应的超时 · 回切首选路径前的持续健康时长。由客户端控制并同步切换结果至服务端。"

msgid "Requires fresh TCP and native UDP replies on this child. Shared by all flows. This is reachability, not the per-flow probe loss estimate."
msgstr "此子节点的 TCP 和原生 UDP 均需收到有效响应，所有流共享此状态。表示路径可达性，不是各流探测的丢包估计。"

msgid "Time since the last valid TCP reply · time since the last valid UDP reply · continuous healthy duration. Missing samples are shown as a dash."
msgstr "最近一次有效 TCP 响应距今时长 · 最近一次有效 UDP 响应距今时长 · 连续健康时长。无样本显示短横线。"

msgid "TCP returns to leg0 after the stability period. UDP returns to its separately configured preferred leg."
msgstr "TCP 在稳定等待期后返回 leg0。UDP 返回单独配置的首选路径。"

msgid "Sum of remote delivery-rate estimates across active connections, not current throughput or link capacity. Feedback RTT includes DATA on this leg and feedback on the control path (normally leg0, leg1 during failover), including queueing: largest smoothed RTT / smallest recorded RTT."
msgstr "活跃连接的远端交付速率估计之和，并非当前吞吐或链路容量。反馈 RTT 包含此路径传输 DATA 及控制路径回传反馈（通常为 leg0，接管时为 leg1），含排队时延：最大平滑 RTT / 最小记录 RTT。"

msgid "Since process start: attached leg transports · business TCP dial attempts (without recovery, leg0 counts logical connections) · reported remote failures, including closed connections. Shared recovery probes are excluded. An attached lazy transport may still be handshaking; unreported remote events cannot be counted."
msgstr "自进程启动累计：挂接的路径传输实例 · 业务 TCP 拨号尝试（未启用接管时 leg0 为逻辑连接数）· 已报告的远端失败，包含已关闭连接。共享接管探测不计入。延迟建连的传输实例可能仍在握手；未报告的远端事件无法计入。"

#~ msgid "Last error: %s"
#~ msgstr "最近错误：%s"

#~ msgid "Independent cache per server"
#~ msgstr "独立缓存"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Make each DNS server's cache independent for special purposes. If "
#~ "enabled, will slightly degrade performance."
#~ msgstr "独立缓存每个 DNS 服务器的结果以供特殊用途。启用后会略微降低性能。"

#~ msgid "Override destination"
#~ msgstr "覆盖目标地址"

#~ msgid "Override the connection destination address with the sniffed domain."
#~ msgstr "使用嗅探到的域名覆盖连接目标。"

#~ msgid "RDRC timeout"
#~ msgstr "RDRC 超时"

#~ msgid "Store RDRC"
#~ msgstr "存储 RDRC"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Store rejected DNS response cache.<br/>The check results of <code>Address "
#~ "filter DNS rule items</code> will be cached until expiration."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "存储被拒绝的 DNS 响应缓存。<br/><code>地址过滤 DNS 规则</code> 的检查结果"
#~ "将被缓存直到过期。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Timeout of rejected DNS response cache in seconds. <code>604800 (7d)</"
#~ "code> is used by default."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "被拒绝的 DNS 响应缓存超时时间（单位：秒）。默认为 <code>604800（7 天）</"
#~ "code>。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "duration such as 500ms, 2s or 1m"
msgstr "时长，如 500ms、2s 或 1m"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "a duration between %s and %s"
msgstr "介于 %s 与 %s 之间的时长"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Both legs are bound to %s. They may leave through the same uplink and cannot aggregate two lines."
msgstr "两条 leg 都绑定到 %s，可能从同一条上行线路出去，无法聚合两条线路。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Neither leg binds an interface. Unless their nodes route through different uplinks, both legs may leave through the same line and cannot aggregate two lines."
msgstr "两条 leg 都没有绑定接口。除非两个节点经不同上行线路路由，否则可能从同一条线路出去，无法聚合两条线路。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Second path for aggregation, traffic-saving switching and optional failover. Upload and download activate it independently."
msgstr "用于聚合、节流切换和可选故障接管的第二条路径。上传和下载分别独立激活。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Must match the server. Every handshake is authenticated with HMAC-SHA256 and checked against replay. Data encryption is provided by the child nodes, not by this key. Empty disables authentication."
msgstr "须与服务端一致。每次握手都经 HMAC-SHA256 认证并防重放。数据加密由子节点负责，而非此密钥。留空则不认证。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Leg interfaces"
msgstr "leg 接口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Multipath beta10"
msgstr "Multipath beta10"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Requires beta10 (protocol v13) on both endpoints. Defaults are the recommended values: leave the activation and buffer fields empty unless you need a specific behavior. Buffer fields are ceilings, not capacities."
msgstr "两端须为 beta10（协议 v13）。默认值即推荐值：除非需要特定行为，激活和缓冲字段请留空。缓冲字段是上限，不是容量。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Ignored legacy settings"
msgstr "已忽略的旧设置"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Frame size"
msgstr "帧大小"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Maximum DATA payload bytes, excluding headers; shared by upload and download. Frames may be smaller and are read incrementally. Accepts 65536 or 64KB. Default: 64 KiB."
msgstr "DATA 最大载荷字节数，不含帧头；上传和下载共用。帧可以更短，并按增量读取。可填 65536 或 64KB。默认：64 KiB。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Enable aggregation / switching"
msgstr "启用聚合 / 切换"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Client-controlled policy for this direction. When disabled, new data stay on leg0 and move to leg1 only if leg0 fails. Activation logic: condition 1 OR condition 2 OR condition 3. Any enabled condition activates leg1; all three disabled keeps the direction on leg0."
msgstr "由客户端控制的本方向策略。关闭时新数据留在 leg0，仅在 leg0 失效时转到 leg1。激活逻辑：条件 1 或条件 2 或条件 3。任一已启用条件满足即激活 leg1；三者全部关闭则本方向保持在 leg0。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Save leg0 traffic (switch instead of aggregate)"
msgstr "节省 leg0 流量（切换而非聚合）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "After activation and leg1 readiness, new data uses leg1 only. Normal backpressure waits rather than spilling onto leg0. A missing or stalled leg1 lets leg0 take over until it recovers; some control traffic may remain. Disabled by default."
msgstr "激活且 leg1 就绪后，新数据只走 leg1。正常反压时等待，不会溢出到 leg0。leg1 缺失或停滞时由 leg0 接替直至其恢复；仍可能有少量控制流量。默认关闭。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Condition 1: leg0 is the bottleneck"
msgstr "条件 1：leg0 成为瓶颈"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger, enabled by default: unsent data stay at or above half of the current unsent limit for the activation window, and leg0's delivery rate has stopped growing (leg0 has left slow start)."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件，默认启用：未发送数据在激活窗口内持续不低于当前未发送上限的一半，且 leg0 的交付速率已不再增长（leg0 已走出慢启动）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger in Mbps per connection. Empty or 0 disables it. For the behavior before beta10, use 150 with a 1s activation window."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件，单位为每连接 Mbps。留空或 0 为关闭。如需 beta10 之前的行为，填 150 并将激活窗口设为 1s。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Independent OR trigger counting accepted application bytes in this direction. 0 or empty disables it. Accepts 2097152 or 2MB."
msgstr "独立的“或”触发条件，统计本方向已接收的应用字节数。0 或留空为关闭。可填 2097152 或 2MB。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "The byte threshold AND this average rate must both be met. Only condition 3 uses this gate; conditions 1 and 2 remain independent. 0 removes the rate gate."
msgstr "字节阈值与此平均速率须同时满足。仅条件 3 使用此门限；条件 1 和 2 保持独立。0 表示取消速率门限。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Duration used for rate sampling and sustained queue pressure, such as 200ms or 1s; a bare number means seconds. Range 20ms to 10s. Default: 200ms. Each connection and direction triggers independently."
msgstr "速率采样与持续排队判断所用的时长，如 200ms 或 1s；纯数字表示秒。范围 20ms–10s。默认：200ms。每个连接、每个方向独立触发。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Advanced ceiling: unsent data"
msgstr "高级上限：未发送数据"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Upper bound of data waiting to be assigned to a path, in frame-size units. The working value follows the delivery rate (about 10ms of data, at least 1 MiB). Empty uses 256; range 8 to 4096."
msgstr "等待分配到路径的数据上限，以帧大小为单位。实际值跟随交付速率（约 10ms 的数据量，至少 1 MiB）。留空为 256；范围 8–4096。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Advanced ceiling: send history"
msgstr "高级上限：发送历史"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Upper bound of bytes retained at this direction's sender until Data ACK, both legs and unsent data included. The working value is about twice the bandwidth-delay product within the host's fair share. Empty is 512 MiB."
msgstr "本方向发送端在 Data ACK 之前保留的字节上限，含两条 leg 与未发送数据。实际值约为两倍带宽时延积，并受本机公平份额约束。留空为 512 MiB。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Advanced ceiling: receive window"
msgstr "高级上限：接收窗口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Upper bound of the window at this direction's receiver: server for upload, client for download. The working value is the session's fair share of the receiver's memory. Empty is 512 MiB."
msgstr "本方向接收端窗口的上限：上传为服务端，下载为客户端。实际值为该会话在接收端内存中的公平份额。留空为 512 MiB。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Path stall timeout floor"
msgstr "路径停滞超时下限"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Duration such as 500ms or 2s; empty keeps adaptive timing. Range 100ms to 5m. This is a lower bound on no-progress detection, not a fixed retransmission interval or a disconnect timer."
msgstr "时长，如 500ms 或 2s；留空为自适应。范围 100ms–5m。这是无进展检测的下限，不是固定重传间隔或断连计时。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Duration such as 10s; a bare number means seconds. Range 1s to 60s. Default: 10s."
msgstr "时长，如 10s；纯数字表示秒。范围 1s–60s。默认：10s。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Multipath early write"
msgstr "Multipath 提前写入"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Send the multipath handshake together with the first data and save one round trip. Enabled by default. TCP Fast Open inside the child nodes is configured on those nodes."
msgstr "把 multipath 握手与首批数据一起发送，节省一个往返。默认启用。子节点内部的 TCP Fast Open 在各自节点上配置。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Client-only, disabled by default. TCP sessions already survive the loss of either leg without it; failover adds shared health checks, path selection for new sessions, a UDP relay that keeps the server UDP socket across path switches, and session retention across long outages. Allow both TCP and UDP on the server port; both child nodes must support UDP. UDP is not aggregated."
msgstr "仅客户端，默认关闭。不开启时 TCP 会话也能在任一 leg 丢失后继续；故障接管额外提供共享健康检查、新会话选路、切换路径时保留服务端 UDP socket 的 UDP 中继，以及长时间中断时的会话保留。服务端端口须同时放行 TCP 和 UDP；两个子节点都必须支持 UDP。UDP 不做聚合。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Time without a fresh TCP or UDP health reply before the shared path is unavailable, such as 5s; a bare number means seconds. Range 1s to 5m. Default: 5s. These probes are shared by all connections, not sent per flow."
msgstr "共享路径在多久没有新的 TCP 或 UDP 健康回应后判为不可用，如 5s；纯数字表示秒。范围 1s–5m。默认：5s。这些探测由所有连接共享，不按流发送。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/node.js
msgid "Longest time the preferred path must stay healthy before returning after it failed: 3s at first, doubling with repeated failures up to this value. Range 1s to 1h. Default: 30s. First healthy discovery at startup has no return delay. A single missed probe does not restart the hold; another full failure timeout does. If the fallback fails, an available preferred path is used immediately."
msgstr "首选路径故障后需持续健康多久才回切的最长时间：首次 3s，反复故障时翻倍，至多此值。范围 1s–1h。默认：30s。启动时首次确认健康无需等待。单次漏探测不会重置计时，完整的失效超时才会。若备用路径也失效，则立即使用可用的首选路径。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/server.js
msgid "Must match the clients. Every handshake is authenticated with HMAC-SHA256 and checked against replay. Data encryption is provided by the child protocols, not by this key. Without a key or allowed sources, anyone who can reach this port can relay through this server."
msgstr "须与客户端一致。每次握手都经 HMAC-SHA256 认证并防重放。数据加密由子协议负责，而非此密钥。既无密钥也无来源限制时，任何能访问此端口的人都能经本服务端转发流量。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/server.js
msgid "Allowed sources"
msgstr "允许的来源"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/server.js
msgid "Accept multipath legs only from these addresses or prefixes, as seen by this server. Empty allows any source."
msgstr "只接受来自这些地址或前缀（以本服务端看到的来源为准）的 multipath leg。留空则不限制来源。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/server.js
msgid "Shared multipath memory budget of this server, such as <code>256MB</code>. Empty or 0 uses min(512 MiB, half of the available memory)."
msgstr "本服务端 multipath 的共享内存预算，如 <code>256MB</code>。留空或 0 为 min(512 MiB, 可用内存的一半)。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/server.js
msgid "Seconds allowed for a leg handshake. Range 1 to 60. Default: 10."
msgstr "leg 握手允许的秒数。范围 1–60。默认：10。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "A leg reached the server after the session had already closed. This is expected for some short connections because the second leg is established asynchronously."
msgstr "某条 leg 到达服务端时会话已关闭。由于第二条 leg 异步建立，部分短连接出现这种情况属正常。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "The server rejected the pre-shared key. Configure the same key on this node and on the server inbound, and check that both clocks are within two minutes."
msgstr "服务端拒绝了预共享密钥。请在本节点和服务端入站配置相同的密钥，并确认两端时钟相差不超过两分钟。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "The two endpoints run different multipath protocol versions. Upgrade sing-box on both the client and the server to beta10."
msgstr "两端运行的 multipath 协议版本不同。请把客户端和服务端的 sing-box 都升级到 beta10。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "The server holds this session with different parameters. This can follow a configuration change while connections were open; new connections use the new parameters."
msgstr "服务端以不同参数持有该会话。这可能是连接未关闭时修改了配置所致；新连接会使用新参数。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "A dial or handshake operation timed out. The leg is redialed with backoff while the session continues on the other leg."
msgstr "拨号或握手超时。该 leg 会按退避重拨，会话在另一条 leg 上继续。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Traffic saving active"
msgstr "节流模式运行中"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "leg0 recovery fallback"
msgstr "leg0 恢复回退"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "leg0"
msgstr "leg0"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Aggregate"
msgstr "聚合"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "leg1 only"
msgstr "仅 leg1"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "leg0 fallback"
msgstr "leg0 回退"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Failover"
msgstr "故障接管"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "No active connections"
msgstr "没有活跃连接"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Upload policy"
msgstr "上传策略"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Download policy"
msgstr "下载策略"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Data policy"
msgstr "数据策略"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "leg0 only (leg1 if leg0 fails)"
msgstr "仅 leg0（leg0 失效时用 leg1）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Switch to leg1 after activation"
msgstr "激活后切换到 leg1"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Aggregate after activation"
msgstr "激活后聚合"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Configured by the client for this direction. Traffic-saving waits on healthy leg1 backpressure; a missing or stalled leg1 lets leg0 take over. Control traffic may use either leg. UDP is independent."
msgstr "由客户端为本方向配置。节流模式下健康 leg1 反压时等待；leg1 缺失或停滞时由 leg0 接替。控制流量可走任一 leg。UDP 独立。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Activation: 1 OR 2 OR 3"
msgstr "激活：1 或 2 或 3"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Any enabled condition activates leg1"
msgstr "任一已启用条件即可激活 leg1"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Disabled by master switch"
msgstr "已被总开关关闭"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Per connection and direction: condition 1 OR condition 2 OR condition 3. All disabled means no activation. Activation persists for the connection lifetime; there is no low-rate deactivation."
msgstr "按连接和方向：条件 1 或条件 2 或条件 3。全部关闭则不激活。激活在连接生命周期内保持，不会因速率降低而退出。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "1. leg0 is the bottleneck"
msgstr "1. leg0 成为瓶颈"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Unsent data stay at or above half of the current unsent limit for the activation window, and leg0's delivery rate has stopped growing (leg0 has left slow start)."
msgstr "未发送数据在激活窗口内持续不低于当前未发送上限的一半，且 leg0 的交付速率已不再增长（leg0 已走出慢启动）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "2. Average TX rate"
msgstr "2. 平均发送速率"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Sender average application rate over the activation window. Zero disables this condition."
msgstr "发送端在激活窗口内的平均应用速率。0 关闭此条件。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "3. Cumulative bytes / Minimum rate"
msgstr "3. 累计字节 / 最低速率"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "No rate gate"
msgstr "无速率门限"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Cumulative accepted application bytes AND the minimum average rate over a complete window. The rate gate applies only to condition 3. Zero bytes disables condition 3; zero minimum removes the gate."
msgstr "累计接收的应用字节，且完整窗口内的最低平均速率。速率门限仅作用于条件 3。字节为 0 关闭条件 3；最低速率为 0 取消门限。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Sender sampling interval for rate and sustained queue checks."
msgstr "发送端用于速率和持续排队判断的采样间隔。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Unsent data: ceiling · live"
msgstr "未发送数据：上限 · 实时"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Data waiting to be assigned to a path. The live limit follows the delivery rate of the carrying paths (about 10 ms of data, at least 1 MiB) and is the largest among open connections."
msgstr "等待分配到路径的数据。实时上限跟随承载路径的交付速率（约 10 ms 的数据量，至少 1 MiB），取开放连接中的最大值。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Send history: ceiling · live"
msgstr "发送历史：上限 · 实时"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Bytes retained at the sender until cumulative Data ACK, both paths and unsent data included. The live limit is about twice the bandwidth-delay product within the sender's fair memory share, largest among open connections."
msgstr "发送端在累计 Data ACK 前保留的字节，含两条路径和未发送数据。实时上限约为两倍带宽时延积，受发送端公平内存份额约束，取开放连接中的最大值。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Receive window: ceiling · live"
msgstr "接收窗口：上限 · 实时"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "server share"
msgstr "服务端份额"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Window at the receiver: server for upload, client for download. The live window is each active session's fair share of the receiver's memory."
msgstr "接收端的窗口：上传为服务端，下载为客户端。实时窗口为每个活跃会话在接收端内存中的公平份额。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Optional lower bound on adaptive sender no-progress detection. Applies to either path, not a fixed retransmission or disconnect timer."
msgstr "发送端自适应无进展检测的可选下限。适用于任一路径，不是固定的重传或断连计时。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Upload modes"
msgstr "上传模式"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid " (stale)"
msgstr "（过期）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Current connections by sender policy: leg0 before activation; aggregate uses both; leg1 is traffic-saving; leg0 fallback permits recovery; failover uses the surviving path. Busy leg1 writers do not cause fallback."
msgstr "按发送策略统计的当前连接：激活前为 leg0；聚合使用两条；leg1 为节流；leg0 回退用于恢复；故障接管使用存活路径。leg1 写入繁忙不会导致回退。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Download modes"
msgstr "下载模式"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Server-reported modes for current connections. Missing or stale samples are Unknown. Aggregate and traffic-saving modes also require the same connection to have a locally attached booster; zero throughput alone does not invalidate a mode."
msgstr "服务端报告的当前连接模式。缺失或过期的样本为未知。聚合和节流模式还要求同一连接在本地挂接了第二条 leg；仅吞吐为零不会使模式失效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "No fresh reply timeout · continuous healthy period before returning after a previously healthy path fails. First healthy discovery at startup has no return delay. Values are controlled by the client and synchronized to the server."
msgstr "无新回应的超时 · 曾健康的路径故障后回切前须连续健康的时长。启动时首次确认健康无需等待。数值由客户端控制并同步到服务端。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Maximum DATA payload in either direction, excluding headers. Short frames and incremental reads remain supported."
msgstr "任一方向的 DATA 最大载荷，不含帧头。仍支持短帧和增量读取。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Repairs"
msgstr "修复"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Each direction, cumulative since process start: repaired bytes / repaired ranges / path stall detections. Repairs cover receiver-dropped ranges, failed or stalled paths and opportunistic reinjection. A stall can recover before any repair. These are not TCP/QUIC retransmissions or IP packet loss counters."
msgstr "每个方向自进程启动以来的累计值：修复字节 / 修复区间 / 路径停滞检测次数。修复包括接收端丢弃的区间、失效或停滞的路径以及机会性重注入。停滞可能在修复前恢复。这些不是 TCP/QUIC 重传或 IP 丢包计数。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Opportunistic / tail reinjection"
msgstr "机会性 / 尾部重注入"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Each direction, cumulative: head data resent on an idle path because the other path held the connection head back · data resent at the end of a transfer because the slower path would deliver it later (bytes). Whichever copy arrives first is used."
msgstr "每个方向的累计值：因另一路径卡住连接队头而在空闲路径上重发队头数据的次数 · 因较慢路径会更晚送达而在传输尾部重发的次数（字节）。先到的副本生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Local current / peak / limit memory, followed by remote current / peak memory. Remote values come from server telemetry."
msgstr "本地当前 / 峰值 / 上限内存，其后为远端当前 / 峰值内存。远端数值来自服务端遥测。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Local memory regions"
msgstr "本地内存分区"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "TX"
msgstr "发送"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "RX"
msgstr "接收"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "reserved"
msgstr "预留"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "cache"
msgstr "缓存"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Transmit payload · receive pages · fixed session reservations · reusable cache. Transmit and receive borrow from each other but always leave the other side a reserve."
msgstr "发送载荷 · 接收页 · 固定会话预留 · 可复用缓存。发送与接收互相借用，但总会给对方留出保底。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Fair shares"
msgstr "公平份额"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "senders"
msgstr "发送会话"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "receivers"
msgstr "接收会话"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "receive window"
msgstr "接收窗口"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Sessions that moved data within the last second, and the receive window each active receiver currently gets."
msgstr "最近一秒内有数据移动的会话数，以及每个活跃接收会话当前获得的接收窗口。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "leg1 · Secondary"
msgstr "leg1 · 第二路径"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "minimum"
msgstr "最小"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Sum of remote delivery-rate estimates across active connections, not current throughput or link capacity. Feedback RTT includes DATA on this leg and the first feedback copy to return on either leg, including queueing: largest smoothed RTT / smallest recorded RTT."
msgstr "活跃连接远端交付速率估计之和，不是当前吞吐或链路容量。反馈 RTT 包括本 leg 上的 DATA 与任一 leg 上最先返回的反馈副本，含排队：最大平滑 RTT / 最小记录 RTT。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "In flight / limit"
msgstr "在途 / 上限"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Each direction: bytes sent on this path and not yet confirmed by a path receipt · the most this path may hold (only bounded until its first delivery sample). Summed across active connections. Download is remote telemetry."
msgstr "每个方向：已在本路径发送、尚未被路径回执确认的字节 · 本路径最多可持有的量（仅在首个交付样本前受限）。为活跃连接之和。下载为远端遥测。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Feedback frames"
msgstr "反馈帧"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Window feedback frames sent and received on this leg since process start. Feedback uses the least blocked leg and copies the other leg at least every 20 ms, so both legs normally carry some."
msgstr "自进程启动以来本 leg 收发的窗口反馈帧。反馈走写入阻塞最轻的 leg，并至少每 20 ms 在另一条 leg 上发一份副本，因此两条 leg 通常都会承载一些。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Writer queue"
msgstr "写入队列"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Each direction: bytes queued to this leg's writer and not yet handed to the child transport. Current is summed across active connections; peak since process start. Download is remote telemetry."
msgstr "每个方向：已排给本 leg 写入器、尚未交给子传输的字节。当前值为活跃连接之和；峰值自进程启动起。下载为远端遥测。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/homeproxy/multipath.js
msgid "Unsupported status schema: %s. This page requires singbox-multipath beta10 status schema 5; upgrade sing-box on both endpoints and restart HomeProxy."
msgstr "不支持的状态 schema：%s。本页面需要 singbox-multipath beta10 的状态 schema 5；请升级两端的 sing-box 并重启 HomeProxy。"
